/T (MONTHLY REVENUE ANALYSIS SUMMARY  THE BUSINESS SHOWS RELATIVELY STABLE REVENUE PERFORMANCE THROUGHOUT THE YEAR, WITH NOTICEABLE PEAKS IN JULY, MAY, AND NOVEMBER, INDICATING STRONG MID-YEAR AND PRE-FESTIVE DEMAND. REVENUE DECLINES SLIGHTLY DURING FEBRUARY, SEPTEMBER, AND OCTOBER, SUGGESTING POTENTIAL SEASONAL SLOWDOWNS. OVERALL, THE UPWARD SPIKES AND CONSISTENT AVERAGES REFLECT HEALTHY DEMAND, WHILE LOWER-PERFORMING MONTHS HIGHLIGHT OPPORTUNITIES FOR TARGETED PROMOTIONS AND DEMAND-STIMULATION STRATEGIES.)
/E (MONTHLY REVENUE ANALYSIS SUMMARY  THE BUSINESS SHOWS RELATIVELY STABLE REVENUE PERFORMANCE THROUGHOUT THE YEAR, WITH NOTICEABLE PEAKS IN JULY, MAY, AND NOVEMBER, INDICATING STRONG MID-YEAR AND PRE-FESTIVE DEMAND. REVENUE DECLINES SLIGHTLY DURING FEBRUARY, SEPTEMBER, AND OCTOBER, SUGGESTING POTENTIAL SEASONAL SLOWDOWNS. OVERALL, THE UPWARD SPIKES AND CONSISTENT AVERAGES REFLECT HEALTHY DEMAND, WHILE LOWER-PERFORMING MONTHS HIGHLIGHT OPPORTUNITIES FOR TARGETED PROMOTIONS AND DEMAND-STIMULATION STRATEGIES.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
